# Ignore every OpenScript study written on this machine
*.oscript

# But keep this .gitignore and the folder README
!.gitignore
!README.md

# Ignore backups, including the one taken on every save from the browser
*.bak
*.backup
*~

# Keep the directory but ignore its contents beyond the exceptions above.

# The compiled program written beside a script on save. It is derived from the
# script, which is itself ignored above, and the production container reads it
# instead of compiling. Committing one would put a build artifact of somebody's
# private strategy in the repository.
*.program.json

# A copy somebody kept of a script before replacing it. Same class as the
# script itself: their work, not the repository's.
*.keep
